===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# [[disreputable|Disreputable]], [[roguish]].
#* {{RQ:Trollope He Knew|volume=I|chapter=Miss Stanbury’s Generosity|page=93|passage=[H]e is dressed in such a '''rapscallion''' manner that the people would think you were talking to a house-breaker.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1895|author=w:Charlotte M. Yonge|chapter=23|title=The Carbonels
|passage="I baint a-going to give my master's property to a lot of '''rapscallion''' thieves and robbers like you."}}

